    "detailed_description": "Tank Team, the ultimate game of cooperation, coordination and most importantly: <strong>communication</strong>.<br><br>Assemble a team of up to 8 players (recommended 2 minimum) and operate your tank by doing tasks, such as rotating the barrel, loading the shells, setting the power and pressing <strong>FIRE!</strong><br><br>However, only one member of your team can see outside the tank at a time, so you're going to need precise communication to land your shots...<br><br>The last team standing, <strong>wins!</strong><br><br><strong>Free Version</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Host and join lobbies<br></li><li>Play the default premade maps<br></li><li>Experience the core of the game</li></ul><br>If you'd like to help support the development of the game and get the full Tank Team experience, you can purchase the &quot;Full Version&quot; DLC!<br><br><strong>Full Version</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock cool cosmetics<br></li><li>Earn currency by playing games<br></li><li>Use the level editor to create custom maps<br></li><li>As a host, you can play custom Workshop maps</li></ul><br>And don't forget: <strong>Teamwork makes the tank work!</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "Tank Team, the ultimate game of cooperation, coordination and most importantly: <strong>communication</strong>.<br><br>Assemble a team of up to 8 players (recommended 2 minimum) and operate your tank by doing tasks, such as rotating the barrel, loading the shells, setting the power and pressing <strong>FIRE!</strong><br><br>However, only one member of your team can see outside the tank at a time, so you're going to need precise communication to land your shots...<br><br>The last team standing, <strong>wins!</strong><br><br><strong>Free Version</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Host and join lobbies<br></li><li>Play the default premade maps<br></li><li>Experience the core of the game</li></ul><br>If you'd like to help support the development of the game and get the full Tank Team experience, you can purchase the &quot;Full Version&quot; DLC!<br><br><strong>Full Version</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock cool cosmetics<br></li><li>Earn currency by playing games<br></li><li>Use the level editor to create custom maps<br></li><li>As a host, you can play custom Workshop maps</li></ul><br>And don't forget: <strong>Teamwork makes the tank work!</strong>",
    "short_description": "A team based PVP game where groups of up to 8 players must work together to operate a tank!",
